---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Hilmall Cloud - Technical content about AI infrastructure, bug bounty, blockchain, and modern DevOps.">
  <Header />
  <main class="flex-1 bg-dark">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-8">About Hilmall Cloud</h1>
      
      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8">
          Hilmall Cloud is a technical publication focused on infrastructure engineering, 
          security research, and modern DevOps practices. We write for practitioners who 
          build and operate production systems.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">What We Cover</h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 not-prose">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-dark-border bg-dark-card p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Infrastructure</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
              Linux VPS administration, Docker containerization, Kubernetes orchestration, 
              and cloud-native architecture.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-dark-border bg-dark-card p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Blockchain</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
              Validator node operations, consensus mechanisms, and blockchain infrastructure 
              for networks like Solana and Ethereum.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-dark-border bg-dark-card p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Security</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
              Bug bounty hunting, web application security, penetration testing, and 
              responsible disclosure practices.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-dark-border bg-dark-card p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">AI & ML</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
              AI agent architecture, LLM integration, and machine learning infrastructure 
              for production workloads.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">Our Approach</h2>
        <p>
          Every article is written from hands-on experience. We don't cover theoretical 
          concepts we haven't implemented ourselves. When we write about running Solana 
          validators, it's because we operate them. When we cover Docker security, it's 
          because we've hardened production containers.
        </p>
        <p>
          We believe in:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Practical over theoretical</strong> — Real commands, real configs, real experience</li>
          <li><strong>Security first</strong> — Every guide includes security considerations</li>
          <li><strong>Production-ready</strong> — Code you can deploy, not just examples</li>
          <li><strong>Continuous learning</strong> — The infrastructure space evolves; so do we</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">Our Infrastructure</h2>
        <p>
          This site is hosted on Evolution Host's high-performance VPS infrastructure. 
          We chose Evolution Host for their reliable network, competitive pricing, and 
          support for the types of workloads we write about — from blockchain nodes to 
          AI inference endpoints.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Have questions, suggestions, or want to contribute? Reach out through our 
          <a href="/contact" class="text-primary hover:underline">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
